  "faqA3": "Full Encyclopedia and trail content, unlimited Mystic Counselor, complete magical weather, personalized suggestions from transits, advanced lunar calendar, and sync across devices",
  "faqQ4": "How do I redeem a Premium Code?",
  "faqA4": "Open Settings → Subscription and use the \"Have a Premium Code?\" field to enter and redeem your code",
  "faqQ5": "How do I change the app language?",
  "faqA5": "In Settings → Language. The app is available in Portuguese, English, and Spanish; the change applies instantly",
  "faqQ6": "How do Moon and Sabbat notifications work?",
  "faqA6": "Enable them in Settings → Notifications. Tapping a notification opens the app directly on the corresponding Encyclopedia page",
